WEBVTT

00:00:03.008 --> 00:00:13.013
News: next month the government starts ex officio investigations of breached companies. No report needed — they find it, they show up.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:21.013
Ex officio means the state finds you first. The first question is always where your data lives.

00:00:21.013 --> 00:00:29.385
Just deploy more agents! We will audit ourselves ex officio — one at the gate, two in the server room.

00:00:31.018 --> 00:00:35.865
Hold on — where does the ex officio audit log go?

00:00:35.865 --> 00:00:40.020
Inside, of course. A log is data too.

00:00:43.028 --> 00:00:53.033
Verdict: nothing found. The data never left this wall — the log is simply too long to carry through the gate.

